    junzibuqi: {
        title: "鍚涘瓙涓嶅櫒鈥斺€斿悰瀛愪笉鐩",
        date: "2006/2/4 11:54:32",
        content: `
            <div class="chapter-divider">
                <span>鍚涘瓙涓嶅櫒鈥斺€斿悰瀛愪笉鐩?/span>
            </div>

            <section class="content-section quote-section">
                <div class="section-label">鍘熸枃</div>
                <div class="lunyu-sentence">
                    瀛愭洶锛氬悰瀛愪笉鍣ㄣ€?
                </div>
                <div class="sentence-origin">鈥斺€斻€婅璇€嬩负鏀跨瘒</div>
            </section>

            <section class="content-section">
                <div class="section-label">鍚勫瑙ｉ噴</div>
                <div class="scholars-grid">
                    <div class="scholar-card">
