            </section>

            <section class="content-section">
                <div class="section-label">缂犱腑璇寸璇﹁В</div>
                <div class="explanation-content">
                    <p>涓婇潰鍙婇€氬父鐨勬柇鍙ラ兘鏄?涓夊勾瀛︼紝涓嶈嚦鏂兼锛屼笉鏄撳緱涔?銆傛寜杩欑閫昏緫锛?鐧惧勾瀛︼紝涓嶈嚦鏂兼锛屾洿涓嶆槗寰椾篃"锛?/p>

                    <h3 style="margin: 20px 0 15px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent);">涓€銆佹纭柇鍙?/h3>
                    <div class="key-quote">
                        <p><strong>"涓夊勾瀛︿笉鑷筹紝鏂艰胺涓嶆槗锛屽緱涔?</strong></p>
                    </div>

                    <h3 style="margin: 20px 0 15px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent);">浜屻€佸叧閿瘝瑙ｈ</h3>
                    <div class="word-analysis">
                        <div class="word-item">
